      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEVIA (7) ran fourth last start at Kilmore over 2180m, beaten 7 metres. Talented and has plenty of upside. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Meets a comparable field and she can play a major role in the outcome. VAN NOSTRAND (3) resumes from a spell of eight months after closing off last campaign in good form, the last run being a solid third over 1720m at Melton. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Will have plenty of admirers. WAR DAN PHOENIX (2) finished eighth two runs ago then broke and finished a distant last over 1720m at Melton at the latest appearance. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets a similar line up so if he behaves a big run is likely. KLYMENE (1) is in the mix if she can recapture the form from two starts back that saw her finish third over 2080m at this track.",
